<button type="button" class="task-generation-message mx-auto mt-5 flex w-full max-w-2xl items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-calm-blue/30 bg-blue-50 px-5 py-4 text-left text-dark-blue shadow-sm hover:opacity-70" data-controller="dismissible" data-action="dismissible#dismiss" aria-label="タスク生成完了メッセージを閉じる">
  <svg class="task-generation-message__icon size-11 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">
    <circle class="completion-circle stroke-calm-blue" cx="50" cy="50" r="42" fill="none" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" />
    <path class="completion-check stroke-calm-blue" d="M28 52 L43 67 L73 35" fill="none" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
  </svg>
  <span class="task-generation-message__content leading-relaxed">
    <strong class="task-generation-message__heading block font-bold">タスクを生成しました。</strong>
    <span class="task-generation-message__description mt-1 block text-sm text-calm-blue sm:text-base">タスクの追加・編集・削除ができます。タスクの順番も自由に並べ替えられます。</span>
  </span>
</button>
